  "script": "Meet the 2017 Mercedes-AMG GT, a stunning blend of speed and style. This beast offers impressive performance that turns heads wherever it goes. Under the hood, you get a handcrafted 4.0-liter twin-turbo V8. It churns out a hefty 469 horsepower, delivering exhilarating acceleration. Power is sent to the rear wheels, making for a thrilling driving experience. The seven-speed dual-clutch gearbox is quick and precise. It competes with the Porsche 911 but offers a distinct experience. You get similar performance, with a slightly lower price tag. The GT's engine is ripe for tuning. With the right tweaks, you can easily extract more power and personalize driving dynamics. So, is the 2017 Mercedes-AMG GT the right sports car for your garage? Its mix of power, luxury, and value might just seal the deal.",
